{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Weapons|$Metal Arrow}}

A {{PAGENAME}} is ammunition for the [[Hunter's Bow]]. You can keep up to 30 arrows in a [[Hunter's Quiver]] by picking up the arrows and right clicking them onto the quiver, or opening the quiver inventory by right-clicking on the quiver.

''See also [[Bone Arrow]] and [[Stone Arrow]]''
==How to Acquire==

First you need to wield a [[smithy's hammer]] in one hand. Then right click an [[anvil]].

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality = <math>\frac{\frac{_{q}Nugget+ _{q}String+ _{q}Branch}{3} *  9 + {_{q}Anvil* 4 + _{q}Smithy's Hammer}* 3}{16}</math> and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[2]{Dexterity*Survival}</math>.

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] damage at any given quality is <math>20*\sqrt{Quality_{Arrow}/10}</math>

